                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of morning fog. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the late morning and afternoon. Light winds becoming east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the middle of the day then becoming light in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 7 with daytime temperatures reaching around 15.</text>
